+the post-change date (p = 0.105); an unplanned analysis found that the timings differ, with the 1-month
+image lowest, an effect concentrated in one city and confounded with change already visible in that image.
+With full input, DS-UNet scored above all U-Net baselines across training seeds, but in an exploratory
+resampling of the test cities its lead over the SAR-only U-Net was concentrated in one city and not
+established. For the SAR-only U-Net, adding VH to VV lowered F1. With composite clouds, masking and
+zero-filling cloud pixels let the dropout model score above a SAR-only fallback. All results concern one
+benchmark, one architecture family and one training recipe, and undetected differences are not evidence of
+no effect.
 
