-difference is detectable. Both statements concern these two architectures with 3-month mean backscatter.
-VH is also a robustness risk: one city with a missing VH acquisition nearly halved the pooled F1 of the
-VV+VH model.
-Dual-stream fusion with full input. The dual-stream gain over input fusion (RQ4) and the absence of
