 Missing and cloudy are different problems. Robustness to a missing image does not transfer to a
 partly corrupted one: a dropout-trained model learns that a zero-filled optical image carries no information,
@@ -685,79 +852,109 @@ post-change image. Combined with RQ1, this suggests a practical reading that is
